#, python-brace-format
msgid "Why the Python package has three interfaces where R has one: {doc}`../explanation/three-tier-api`."
msgstr "Mengapa paket Python memiliki tiga antarmuka sedangkan R hanya satu: {doc}`../explanation/three-tier-api`."

